# Optional CARTO Dark Matter basemap API key.
# Create a free key at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/ and copy this file to
# .env.local in the frontend/ directory. Vite reads .env.local at dev/build time.
#
# Without a key the map automatically uses OpenStreetMap raster tiles with a
# dark map-only visual treatment and the required attribution.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
